    <activityDescription>
      <activity id="da2345f7-5254-515e-bb47-aca4460b7499" activityNameId="34666094-329a-5ac0-b883-53666a660c7e" activityNameContextId="f44c43c1-5cc5-54a6-ade6-24435bd12c83" type="1" specialActivityType="0" energyValues="0">
        <activityName xml:lang="en">xxx Electricity, medium voltage, at grid</activityName>
        <generalComment>
          <text xml:lang="en" index="1">Full activity name: xxx Electricity, medium voltage, at grid
This dataset describes the transformation from high to medium voltage as well as the transmission of electricity at medium voltage.;
UUID: 0a537975-4fb6-3f63-b83a-a461c4a00630
Included are the electricity production in Serbia and from imports, the transmission network and direct SF6-emissions to air. Electricity losses during medium-voltage transmission and transformation from high-voltage are accounted for.
Location: Data apply to public and self producers. Geographical classification according to IEA. Assumptions for transmission network, losses and emissions are based on UTCE data.
Technology: Average technology used to transmit and distribute electricity. Includes underground and overhead lines, as well as air-, vacuum- and SF6-insulated high-to-medium voltage switching stations. Electricity production according to related datasets
Time period: Time of publications.
Production volume: 30 TWh
Sampling: statistics 
Extrapolations: &lt;null&gt;
Uncertainty adjustments: none
BAFU mapped export: unsupported biosphere exchanges excluded; see audit/. Local UUIDs and generic activity classification are export conventions. Source: process_0a537975-4fb6-3f63-b83a-a461c4a00630.xml</text>
        </generalComment>
      </activity>
